# core/README.md, db/README.md. Everything below is planning/handbook material.
# SPEC.md and ARCHITECTURE.md were retired on 2026-08-09 — the plan now lives in
# docs/plans/roadmap.md and the architecture in the per-directory READMEs.
CLAUDE.md
resources/
docs/

# ── Claude Code (AI assistant) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/

# ── Local developer guides (personal, not for shared repo) ───────────────────
GIT_CONVENTIONS.md

# ── IDE settings ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/


